{"1761340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Madnessarum", "steam_appid": 1761340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy from your own camp to a lost island. Explore its reaches, uncover clues about secret locations and mysterious creatures, gather resources, and build your base. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Terror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac90a944.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac90a944.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac90a944.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, the fear of the unknown awaits. You will encounter driven-mad survivors and horrors that defy description. To overcome the most formidable of them, you will need to secure high-end equipment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f6e081456dbfbe2158c735f71eddfe07.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f6e081456dbfbe2158c735f71eddfe07.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f6e081456dbfbe2158c735f71eddfe07.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player chooses their own approach for each expedition. Every enemy has its own unique strengths and weaknesses. Whether you face the island’s horrors head-on or seek a stealthy way around is entirely up to you. But remember: every action carries consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78d7958c56f679ced644dccebb91ffa.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78d7958c56f679ced644dccebb91ffa.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78d7958c56f679ced644dccebb91ffa.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with Others</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with friends or strangers to squeeze the most out of your expeditions. Alternatively, become a deadly lone wolf—it all depends on which playstyle suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover a wide variety of locations across the island. Each one offers more than just a unique atmosphere; they present distinct challenges. For instance, settlements are rich with loot, but the danger is significantly higher. Forests may seem safer, but it is easy to lose your way, and while the catacombs hold great treasures, rumors say something truly terrible lies in wait for adventurers there.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy from your own camp to a lost island. Explore its reaches, uncover clues about secret locations and mysterious creatures, gather resources, and build your base. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Terror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac90a944.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac90a944.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/f9d4800e77bfe90a2535241bac9