s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/b78934890f62793b6862d2a6a11403cc.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with friends or strangers to squeeze the most out of your expeditions. Alternatively, become a deadly lone wolf—it all depends on which playstyle suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.poster.avif?t=1776888045\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.webm?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/extras/ca5b064335850efd69d472d105692610.mp4?t=1776888045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover a wide variety of locations across the island. Each one offers more than just a unique atmosphere; they present distinct challenges. For instance, settlements are rich with loot, but the danger is significantly higher. Forests may seem safer, but it is easy to lose your way, and while the catacombs hold great treasures, rumors say something truly terrible lies in wait for adventurers there.</p>", "short_description": "You're stranded on an island with other players. Your goal is to explore the island, collect as many resources as possible, and then try to escape the island to replenish your camp's stock.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Russian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/c3e2c3f21ee2c9c722793feeb8ce42243b10a032/header.jpg?t=1776888045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/601c20dd2fc340017b5f2933345749a37a6fe840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776888045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761340/601c20dd2fc340017b5f2933345749a37a6fe840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776888045", "website": "https://madnessarum.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 10700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MEGALUL"], "publishers": ["MEGALUL"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "de